{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/050c9683a95401c2089ed382a76e8938.poster.avif?t=1772991949\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/050c9683a95401c2089ed382a76e8938.webm?t=1772991949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/050c9683a95401c2089ed382a76e8938.mp4?t=1772991949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAUGHT IN HELL, SINNER?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deserved is the ultimate(yes-yes) 2.5D platformer. You, a sinner, end up in hell for all your vile deeds. Your goal is to climb to the top of hell, collect all soul shards, and purify yourself to escape. But the problem is the demon who trolls, humiliates, mocks, and insults you. You\u2019ll suffer! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He\u2019ll talk to you personally... but not kindly, HUMILIATING AND MOCKING YOU. Over 150 tormenting levels await. No choices? Ha, forget it! One wrong move \u2014 and your progress is gone. Jump, fall, endure taunts, cleanse your soul, and climb out! Dare to survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/4909e0ba902d743acb23186ea8d55e0c.poster.avif?t=1772991949\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/4909e0ba902d743acb23186ea8d55e0c.webm?t=1772991949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/4909e0ba902d743acb23186ea8d55e0c.mp4?t=1772991949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAX!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s not all bad: this is a chill, relaxing game, no stress! JOKE, HAHAHAHA! In Deserved, you just ENDURE AND ENDURE! Endure fails, endure mocks, endure until you smash your keyboard or controller.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/3ffc5c04b8963367e4256160d548bb26.poster.avif?t=1772991949\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/3ffc5c04b8963367e4256160d548bb26.webm?t=1772991949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/3ffc5c04b8963367e4256160d548bb26.mp4?t=1772991949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MUST-HAVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game MUST be in your Steam library \u2014 don\u2019t buy it, and you\u2019ll prove your weakness! Taste real hell! Cleanse your soul through suffering, collect shards, and rise to the top \u2014 or choke and remain a pathetic loser.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/01242da26ef6bc462969b094933d114d.poster.avif?t=1772991949\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/01242da26ef6bc462969b094933d114d.webm?t=1772991949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786110/extras/01242da26ef6bc462969b094933d114d.mp4?t=1772991949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\